  (null, null, 'ca-gma-central', 'salt', 'note', 'It is unlawful to possess a groundfish species or species group within a Groundfish Management Area where the take and possession of those species are prohibited in all waters of that Groundfish Management Area or in excess of the bag limit of that Groundfish Management Area, regardless of if the groundfish species or species group were taken in a different Groundfish Management Area where the take or possession is authorized (CCR T14 §27.20(b)(1)(A)(1)).', 'https://wildlife.ca.gov/Fishing/Ocean/Regulations/Groundfish-Summary', 'CDFW — Summary of Recreational Groundfish Fishing Regulations (updated June 23, 2026)', '2026-06-23', '2026-09-01', 2,
